{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a witch\u2019s canine familiar tasked with saving magical creatures and solving a mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Herdles walks the line between an epic adventure and a puzzle platformer, using barking as the main mechanic of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a dynamic environment of lush hills and forests that get increasingly more magical as the game progresses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no combat or death, instead you are offered multiple humorous and puzzly solutions to deal with adversaries in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Bark Changes Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything reacts to your bark. Reveal secrets, trigger mechanisms, and explore an interactive world full of magic and wonder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/20240627_herdles_barkAtEverything.gif?t=1742390581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>All Roads Lead To Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are multiple ways to progress through the world. Experiment and think out of the box to find the most efficient and/or funniest solutions to any obstacle you might face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/road.gif?t=1742390581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No Hurdles, Just Herdles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Herdles has a strong focus on modern accessibility and offers settings to accommodate people with various disabilities, but also includes a variety of options that change the game itself. Tune the game to your needs/preferences and play it as a challenging parkour with lots of dangers or as a cozy experience without conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2429600?t=1742390581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742390581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742390581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742390581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a witch\u2019s canine familiar tasked with saving magical creatures and solving a mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Herdles walks the line between an epic adventure and a puzzle platformer, using barking as the main mechanic of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a dynamic environment of lush hills and forests that get increasingly more magical as the game progresses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no combat or death, instead you are offered multiple humorous and puzzly solutions to deal with adversaries in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Bark Changes Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything reacts to your bark. Reveal secrets, trigger mechanisms, and explore an interactive world full of magic and wonder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/20240627_herdles_barkAtEverything.gif?t=1742390581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>All Roads Lead To Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are multiple ways to progress through the world. Experiment and think out of the box to find the most efficient and/or funniest solutions to any obstacle you might face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/road.gif?t=1742390581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>No Hurdles, Just Herdles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Herdles has a strong focus on modern accessibility and offers settings to accommodate people with various disabilities, but also includes a variety of options that change the game itself. Tune the game to your needs/preferences and play it as a challenging parkour with lots of dangers or as a cozy experience without conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["One More Journey Studios","Fire Sword Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/header.jpg?t=1742390581","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116301,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116301/movie480.mp4?t=1742390330","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116301/movie_max.mp4?t=1742390330"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116301/a